Murage is a fork of OpenMausBot. Substantial modifications have been made,
including but not limited to: renaming of the product, its identifiers,
configuration paths and network endpoints; replacement of hosted service
endpoints with Ferrox Labs infrastructure; and integration with Wayland Core.

Murage is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the OpenMausBot
project or its contributors.

Murage's common ancestor with OpenMausBot is the 0.1.44 source (commit
6140532e). Everything after that point is selective adaptation, not parity.
Murage does not import whole upstream releases, and no upstream release
should be described as having been imported into Murage.

